bool blocked(float x,float y){if(x<65||x>895||y<235||y>510)return true;for(auto&r:rooms[roomId].blocks)if(x>r.x-10&&x<r.x+r.w+10&&y>r.y&&y<r.y+r.h)return true;return false;}
Obj* nearest(){Obj*best=nullptr;float bd=1e9;for(auto&o:rooms[roomId].objs){float d=hypotf(heroX-o.x,heroY-o.y);if(d<o.reach&&d<bd){best=&o;bd=d;}}return best;}
void battleDone(){if(battleEnemy==0){S.f.tape=true;showStory("tapeAfter");}else if(battleEnemy==1){S.f.para=true;showStory("printerAfter");}else if(battleEnemy==2){S.f.finalBoss=true;S.f.dispatchDone=true;showStory("bossAfter");}else{S.f.dispatchDone=true;showStory("carretelAfter");}saveGame();}
void startBattle(int e){battleEnemy=e;battleMercy=0;battleHP=100;mode=BATTLE;}
void action(int a){switch(a){
 case A_COMPUTER: if(!S.f.tracking){S.f.tracking=true;showStory("tracking");saveGame();}else say("narrator","ENCOMENDA NA CENTRAL. Aguardando retirada no guiche 00.");break;
 case A_ATELIER_DOOR: if(!S.f.tracking)say("calisto","Olha o rastreio primeiro.");else showStory("portal",[](){go(HUB,480,465);});break;
 case A_FABRIC:say("narrator","Tecido, linha e uma tesoura. Alguem afastou tudo para deixar espaco para o bolo.");break;
 case A_BOARD:say("narrator","16 de setembro. Aniversario da Ananda.");break;
 case A_SAVE:saveGame();break;
 case A_TAPE: if(S.f.tape)say("fita","[ploc, ploc. Ele se lembra de voce.]");else showStory("tapeIntro",[](){startBattle(0);});break;
 case A_WEST: if(!S.f.tape)say("apollo","Vamos soltar a fita primeiro.");else go(WORKSHOP,441,477);break;
 case A_EAST: if(!S.f.tape)say("calisto","A gente precisa soltar essa fita pra passar.");else go(STATION,447,479);break;
 case A_GATE: if(!S.f.para||!S.f.com)say("protocolo","Ainda faltam os selos PARA e COM.");else if(!S.f.dispatchStarted){S.f.dispatchStarted=true;showStory("dispatchNotice");}else say("protocolo","A passagem para Curitiba fica no patio, ao sul.");break;
 case A_HOME:go(ATELIER,752,364);break;
 case A_ARANT:showStory("arant");break; case A_SILVER:showStory("silver");break; case A_NOELLE:showStory("noelle");break; case A_VERITY:showStory("verity");break;
 case A_PIPES: if(S.f.para)say("etiqueta","ANANDA CANUTO. PICOS, PI. ENTREGAR EM MAOS.");else {mode=PIPES;pipeCur=0;} break;
 case A_EXIT_HUB:go(HUB,480,470);break; case A_EMIBE:showStory("emibe");break; case A_DRONES:showStory("drones");break;
 case A_BELLS: if(S.f.com)say("aconitum","I will be here. Let me know if you need anything.");else {bellRound=bellPos=0;bellInput=true;mode=BELLS;}break;
 case A_RADIO:say("narrator","ACONITUM · contato adicionado em DONT forget multiplayer.");break;
 case A_COURTYARD: if(roomId==HUB){if(!S.f.tape)say("calisto","Vamos soltar a fita primeiro.");else go(COURTYARD,467,475);}else go(COURTYARD,467,475);break;
 case A_BENCH:showStory("bench");break; case A_PHOTO:mode=PHOTO;photoX=photoY=0;break; case A_ARCHIVE_DOOR:go(ARCHIVE_R,470,470);break;
 case A_ARCHIVE_PUZZLE:mode=ARCHIVE;archiveSel=0;break; case A_BRIDGE_DOOR:go(BRIDGE_R,470,470);break; case A_BRIDGE_PUZZLE:mode=BRIDGE;bridgePX=2;bridgePY=4;boxes[0][0]=3;boxes[0][1]=3;boxes[1][0]=5;boxes[1][1]=3;break;
 case A_DISPATCH_DOOR: if(S.f.bridgeDone)go(DISPATCH,166,477);else say("calisto","O painel precisa acender os dois contatos primeiro.");break;
 case A_SORT: if(S.f.sorted)startBattle(3); else {sortIndex=0;mode=SORTING;}break;
 case A_GUICHE: if(S.f.finalBoss){S.f.parcel=true;showStory("parcel",[](){go(ATELIER,465,450);});} else if(!S.f.dispatchDone)say("protocolo","A caixa esta aqui. Preciso do pedido emitido pela esteira."); else showStory("gate",[](){startBattle(2);});break;
 case A_CALL:showStory("aconitumWindow");break;
 default:break;}}

int rotMask(int m){return ((m<<1)&15)|((m>>3)&1);}bool pipesConnected(){int q[9],qh=0,qt=0;bool seen[9]={0};if(!(pipeCells[0]&8))return false;q[qt++]=0;int bits[4]={1,2,4,8},opp[4]={4,8,1,2},d[4]={-3,1,3,-1};while(qh<qt){int i=q[qh++];if(seen[i])continue;seen[i]=1;if(i==8&&(pipeCells[i]&2))return true;for(int k=0;k<4;k++){if(!(pipeCells[i]&bits[k]))continue;int j=i+d[k];if(j<0||j>8)continue;if((bits[k]==2||bits[k]==8)&&i/3!=j/3)continue;if(pipeCells[j]&opp[k])q[qt++]=j;}}return false;}
void bridgeMove(int dx,int dy){int nx=bridgePX+dx,ny=bridgePY+dy;if(nx<1||nx>6||ny<1||ny>5)return;int bi=-1;for(int i=0;i<2;i++)if(boxes[i][0]==nx&&boxes[i][1]==ny)bi=i;if(bi>=0){int bx=nx+dx,by=ny+dy;if(bx<1||bx>6||by<1||by>5)return;for(int i=0;i<2;i++)if(boxes[i][0]==bx&&boxes[i][1]==by)return;boxes[bi][0]=bx;boxes[bi][1]=by;}bridgePX=nx;bridgePY=ny;if(((boxes[0][0]==3&&boxes[0][1]==1)||(boxes[1][0]==3&&boxes[1][1]==1))&&((boxes[0][0]==6&&boxes[0][1]==2)||(boxes[1][0]==6&&boxes[1][1]==2))){S.f.bridgeDone=true;mode=WORLD;showStory("bridgeDone");saveGame();}}

